No adult business or use restricted hereunder shall be located:
(a) Within one thousand (1,000) feet of any parcel of land which is zoned for multifamily or single-family uses or purposes;
(b) Within one thousand (1,000) feet of any parcel of land upon which a church, school, governmental building simultaneously owned and occupied by such government, library, civic center, neighborhood public park, or neighborhood playground is located;
(c) Within one thousand (1,000) feet of any parcel of land upon which another establishment regulated or defined hereunder is located;
(d) Within the central business district of the city per map on file with the planning department;
(e) Within any zoning category or district other than an adult zoning district (C-A);
(f) For the purposes of this section, distance shall be from property line to property line using the closest property lines of the parcels of land involved. The term "parcel of land" means any quantity of land capable of being described by location and boundary, designated and used, or to be used, as a unit;
(g) Within one thousand (1,000) feet of any parcel of land upon which an establishment is licensed to sell any form of alcoholic beverages;
(h) Within one thousand (1,000) feet of any parcel of land upon which a day care center or child care facility is operated.
(Ord. No. 2021-09, § 1-10, 7-20-21)

